  m_text: 'PACK

    Drag gifts into the box.

    Select the letter, then tap Rotate
    Letter.

    On a computer, you can also hold R while dragging.


    PREPARE

    Weigh
    the parcel. Drag along the seam to tape it.

    Choose the correct label and
    drag it onto the box.


    FINISH

    Send the parcel and give the customer
    their receipt.'
